# Copy to .env and set the final public URL of the site (no trailing slash).
PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.example.com

# --- Secrets: do NOT put these in .env or anywhere in the repository ---------
# The Airbnb / Booking.com iCal export links give access to the booking
# calendar, so they live only as encrypted secrets on Cloudflare:
#   Pages project → Settings → Variables and Secrets → Add (type: Secret)
#     ICAL_AIRBNB    the Airbnb calendar export link
#     ICAL_BOOKING   the Booking.com calendar export link
#     ICAL_EXTRA     optional, further links separated by commas
# They are read only by functions/api/availability.ts on the server and never
# reach the browser. For local testing with `wrangler pages dev`, put them in a
# `.dev.vars` file (git-ignored) or pass them with --binding.
